/comments/2839708872","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105528#issuecomment-2839708872","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105528","id":2839708872,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pQoTI","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-29T17:42:38Z","updated_at":"2025-04-29T17:57:06Z","body":"~You should be able to use `check` after the underscore token was consumed.~ Nvmd I guess it never gets consumed. That being said we can safely consume some tokens in this specific context, which we can use to our advantage to add a special case for the underscore token. The produced error puts the parser into panic mode. After finishing `parse_function` the parser will synchronize. This means we can consume all tokens that are not relevant to `synchronize` as long as we ensure that it doesn't lead to errors inside of `parse_function`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2839708872/react